# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional Kaggle credentials for automated dataset download.
#
# `qingyi/wm811k-wafer-map` is a public dataset. kagglehub can usually download
# public datasets anonymously, but if you hit an authentication/403 error,
# provide credentials in ONE of the following ways:
#
#   1. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values, then `source .env`.
#   2. Export the variables in your shell.
#   3. Place a `kaggle.json` at `~/.kaggle/kaggle.json` (chmod 600).
#
# Get your API token from: https://www.kaggle.com/settings -> "Create New Token"
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# export KAGGLE_USERNAME="your_kaggle_username"
# export KAGGLE_KEY="your_kaggle_api_key"
